---
---
<section class="section section--cream hosts" id="hosts">
  <div class="section__inner">
    <div class="hosts-split">

      <div class="hosts-split__image">
        <div class="hosts-split__image-box">
          <img src="/images/maja-asdru-official.jpg" alt="Maja and Asdrubal, hosts of Casa Arkaana" loading="lazy">
          <div class="hosts-split__image-label">Maja &amp; Asdrubal · Casa Arkaana</div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="hosts-split__text">
        <span class="eyebrow">The Hosts</span>
        <span class="gold-line"></span>
        <h2 class="hosts-split__heading">We are Maja and Asdrubal.</h2>
        <p class="hosts-split__body">
          We built Casa Arkaana with our hands, our family, and twelve years of love for this land. When you marry here, you marry in our home.
        </p>
        <p class="hosts-split__body">
          We've hosted two weddings without ever promoting them. People found us because they were looking for something real — a micro wedding in the jungle, intimate, away from the convention. That's who we build for. We take on six weddings a year — that's it.
        </p>

        <div class="hosts-pull-quote">
          <p class="hosts-pull-quote__text">
            "The best place to have a wonderful ceremony in the Maloka and to rest and digest near the pool. You will feel the love they put in the place."
          </p>
          <p class="hosts-pull-quote__attr">— Google Review, 5 stars</p>
        </div>
      </div>

    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .hosts-split {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    gap: var(--sp-6);
    align-items: center;
  }

  .hosts-split__image-box {
    background: var(--color-cream);
    aspect-ratio: 4/5;
    width: 100%;
    position: relative;
    overflow: hidden;
  }

  .hosts-split__image-box img {
    position: absolute;
    inset: 0;
    width: 100%;
    height: 100%;
    object-fit: cover;
    object-position: center;
  }

  .hosts-split__image-label {
    position: absolute;
    bottom: var(--sp-3);
    left: var(--sp-3);
    font-family: var(--font-sans);
    font-size: 10px;
    letter-spacing: 0.14em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: rgba(255,255,255,0.6);
  }

  .hosts-split__heading {
    font-family: var(--font-serif);
    font-weight: 300;
    font-size: clamp(30px, 4vw, 48px);
    line-height: 1.15;
    letter-spacing: -0.01em;
    margin-bottom: var(--sp-3);
  }

  .hosts-split__body {
    font-family: var(--font-sans);
    font-weight: 300;
    font-size: 16px;
    line-height: 1.75;
    color: var(--color-text);
    margin-bottom: var(--sp-4);
    max-width: 480px;
  }

  .hosts-pull-quote {
    margin-top: var(--sp-4);
    padding: var(--sp-4);
    background: var(--color-cream);
    border-left: 2px solid var(--color-gold);
  }

  .hosts-pull-quote__text {
    font-family: var(--font-serif);
    font-style: italic;
    font-size: 17px;
    font-weight: 300;
    color: var(--color-text);
    line-height: 1.6;
    margin-bottom: var(--sp-2);
  }

  .hosts-pull-quote__attr {
    font-family: var(--font-sans);
    font-size: 12px;
    font-weight: 300;
    letter-spacing: 0.1em;
    color: var(--color-neutral);
  }

  @media (min-width: 768px) {
    .hosts-split {
      grid-template-columns: 55fr 45fr;
      gap: var(--sp-8);
    }

    .hosts-split__image-box {
      aspect-ratio: 3/4;
    }
  }

  @media (min-width: 1200px) {
    .hosts-split {
      gap: var(--sp-15);
    }

    .hosts-split__image-box {
      aspect-ratio: unset;
      min-height: 560px;
    }
  }
</style>
